(56134, 2246, 'Q6134: A person walks 2278m North, turns right and walks 2283m East. Find distance from origin.', '3229 m East', '3220 m North', '3225 m NE', '3235 m SE', 'C', 1, 'Distance = √(2278² + 2283²) = 3225m NE.', 9),
