(56757, 2271, 'Q6757: Pointing to a man, Priya says, "His mother is the only daughter of my mother." How is the man related to Priya?', 'Father', 'Brother', 'Grandfather', 'Sister', 'B', 1, 'Priya\'s mother\'s only daughter is Priya. Man is her son, making relation Brother.', 7),
(56758, 2271, 'Q6758: A man says, "This boy is the son of the wife of my father." How is the boy related if he has no brothers?', 'Father', 'Brother', 'Son', 'Uncle', 'C', 1, 'Father\'s wife is his mother. Son of his mother is himself or brother. Since no brothers, he is his Son.', 8),
(56759, 2271, 'Q6759: A person walks 3528m North, turns right and walks 3533m East. Find distance from origin.', '4997 m East', '4988 m North', '5003 m SE', '4993 m NE', 'D', 1, 'Distance = √(3528² + 3533²) = 4993m NE.', 9),
(56760, 2271, 'Q6760: If South-East becomes North, North-East becomes West, what does West become?', 'South-West', 'North-East', 'South-East', 'North-West', 'A', 1, '135° anti-clockwise rotation turns West into South-East.', 10),
