(57588, 2304, 'Q7588: 5 people (A,B,C,D,E) sit in a row. C is in the middle. Where is C seated?', 'Center / Middle', 'Extreme Left', 'Extreme Right', 'Immediate Right', 'A', 1, 'C occupies 3rd position (Middle).', 13),
