(58207, 2329, 'Q8207: Pointing to a man, Priya says, "His mother is the only daughter of my mother." How is the man related to Priya?', 'Father', 'Grandfather', 'Sister', 'Cousin', 'D', 1, 'Priya\'s mother\'s only daughter is Priya. Man is her son, making relation Cousin.', 7),
