(59439, 2378, 'Q9439: In two parallel rows facing each other, A is opposite to X. How are A and X positioned?', 'Adjacent', 'Diagonal', 'Cannot determine', 'Opposite to each other', 'D', 1, 'A and X are seated directly opposite each other.', 14),
(59440, 2378, 'Q9440: 4 people sit around a circular table facing center. A is clockwise from B. B is to A\'s?', 'Immediate Left', 'Immediate Right', 'Opposite', 'Second to Right', 'A', 1, 'Facing center, clockwise means B is to the Immediate Left of A.', 15),
