(59442, 2378, 'Q9442: Statements: All dogs are mammals. All mammals are animals. Conclusions: I. All dogs are animals. II. All animals are dogs.', 'Only Conclusion II follows', 'Both I and II follow', 'Only Conclusion I follows', 'Neither follows', 'C', 1, 'Dogs ⊂ Mammals ⊂ Animals. Conclusion I follows.', 17),
