(59444, 2378, 'Q9444: Statement: "Drive carefully to avoid accidents." Conclusion I: Careless driving causes accidents.', 'Conclusion I is implicit', 'Conclusion II is implicit', 'Both implicit', 'Neither implicit', 'A', 1, 'The warning directly implies careless driving leads to accidents.', 19),
