(59858, 2395, 'Q9858: A man says, "This boy is the son of the wife of my father." How is the boy related if he has no brothers?', 'Father', 'Brother', 'Son', 'Uncle', 'C', 1, 'Father\'s wife is his mother. Son of his mother is himself or brother. Since no brothers, he is his Son.', 8),
