(65084, 2604, 'Q15084: [Graphs - Traversals] Which graph traversal algorithm uses a First-In-First-Out (FIFO) Queue?', 'Breadth-First Search (BFS)', 'Depth-First Search (DFS)', 'Dijkstra', 'Kruskal', 'A', 1, 'BFS utilizes a Queue to visit nodes level by level.', 9),
