(65901, 2637, 'Q15901: [C/C++ Pointers] What is the size of a pointer in a 64-bit operating system?', '4 bytes', '8 bytes', '2 bytes', '16 bytes', 'B', 1, 'On a 64-bit OS, memory addresses are 64 bits = 8 bytes long.', 1),
