(66109, 2645, 'Q16109: [Graphs - Traversals] Which graph traversal algorithm uses a First-In-First-Out (FIFO) Queue?', 'Depth-First Search (DFS)', 'Breadth-First Search (BFS)', 'Dijkstra', 'Kruskal', 'B', 1, 'BFS utilizes a Queue to visit nodes level by level.', 9),
