(69180, 2768, 'Q19180: [Data Structures - Arrays] What is the time complexity of accessing an element in an array by index?', 'O(1)', 'O(n)', 'O(log n)', 'O(n²)', 'A', 1, 'Arrays provide constant O(1) random access by index via base address calculation.', 5),
