(69280, 2772, 'Q19280: [Data Structures - Arrays] What is the time complexity of accessing an element in an array by index?', 'O(1)', 'O(n)', 'O(log n)', 'O(n²)', 'A', 1, 'Arrays provide constant O(1) random access by index via base address calculation.', 5),
(69281, 2772, 'Q19281: [Data Structures - Linked List] In a singly linked list, what is the time complexity to insert a node at the head?', 'O(n)', 'O(1)', 'O(log n)', 'O(n²)', 'B', 1, 'Inserting at head requires updating head pointer, taking O(1) time.', 6),
